WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,740
A family of three gives me three points a day for free

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,940
The more people there are, the more I earn.

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:11,940
Go back and tell your parents how many kinds to make.

4
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:13,980
The more you sow, the more I will give you.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,700
You can rest assured

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,420
Send him back with white plate and red porridge

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:23,550
Someone bumped into him on the street, Mo Nanqing

8
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:25,110
When you have saved enough, swap out the AK first.

9
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:31,820
AK is gray against red dot zombies

10
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,500
This is a group of living people

11
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:43,090
The captain didn't see a single zombie along the way.

12
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:44,690
It makes people feel pure

13
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:48,860
I don’t care if the tires are hard.

14
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:49,980
There must be someone living inside
